            "action": "CORRECT_ISOLATED_PROPOSAL_EVIDENCE",
            "changes": "Issue1226: Reclassify only ontology_mapping.evidence indices 0 from MANUAL_CURATION to LLM_SUGGESTION. Exact complete objects were rebound to the frozen provenance audit; these entries record documented agent interpretation, not human-supplied evidence. Sources, claim notes and historical entries are retained; ComponentEvidenceTypeEnum and canonical SSSOM ManualMappingCuration are unchanged. Issue1237 W01-PREP-B-002/CHEM-COMP-003: JCM1479 explicitly specifies the L-cysteine hydrochloride monohydrate 5% stock at pH7.0. It is a preparation, separate from solid solute. Unreported pH in another 5% stock establishes neither difference nor equivalence. Percentage basis, carrier and titrant/preparation remain unreported; a common-stock relationship requires affirmative source evidence. Isolated report-only successor; no owner, role, source gate or release approval.",
